		<category><![CDATA[Monthly Mini Model Builds]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114089</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1280" height="720" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Store November 8, 2026 Make &amp; Take Event Magenta Flower Candle for Canada &amp; United Kingdom UK" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>LEGO Stores (Canada &#124; United Kingdom) will be offering a FREE LEGO November 2026 Make &#38; Take building event</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/free-lego-store-make-take-event-on-november-8-2026-magenta-flower-candle-canada-united-kingdom-uk-only/">Free LEGO Store Make &#038; Take Event on November 8, 2026: Magenta Flower Candle (Canada &#038; United Kingdom UK Only)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>LEGO Stores (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">United Kingdom</a>) will be offering a FREE LEGO November 2026 Make &amp; Take building event (Magenta Flower Candle). The candle consists of various colors including purple flowers surrounding the candle.</p>
<p>The event is happening on Sunday, November 8, 2026 from 12-2pm in Canada. For those in the United Kingdom UK, there are two days available the event. They include Saturday, November 7, 2026 from 10am-12pm <span style="text-decoration: underline;">AND</span> Sunday, November 8, 2026 from 12-2pm.</p>
<p>Reservations are not required but it is on a first come, first serve basis. As such, we recommend going to the store early. This event is geared towards those that are aged 7+.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114092 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK.jpg" alt="" width="1164" height="655" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-November-8-2026-Make-Take-Event-Magenta-Flower-Candle-for-Canada-United-Kingdom-UK-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1164px) 100vw, 1164px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Store Magenta Flower Candle (FREE Make &amp; Take Event)</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Canada: </strong>Sunday, November 8, 2026 from 12-2pm</li>
<li><strong>United Kingdom UK:</strong> Saturday, November 7, 2026 from 10am-12pm <span style="text-decoration: underline;">AND</span> Sunday, November 8, 2026 from 12-2pm</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>Note that there are limited quantities for the LEGO Make &amp; Take Builds. You cannot buy these Make &amp; Take builds directly. <strong>A few LEGO Stores may offer the building event on a different day/time.</strong> To avoid disappointment, we recommend calling your physical LEGO Brand Retail Store to confirm availability as well as to see if any reservations are required. To find the nearest official physical LEGO Store in your region, you can check the LEGO Store pages here: <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-52719 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping.jpg" alt="" width="641" height="359" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping.jpg 744w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping-300x168.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" /></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="671" height="339" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 671px) 100vw, 671px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="721" height="576" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 721px) 100vw, 721px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases made. Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. If you click on another affiliate link last (that is not Toys N Bricks), we won’t be able to get any commission. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/free-lego-store-make-take-event-on-november-8-2026-magenta-flower-candle-canada-united-kingdom-uk-only/">Free LEGO Store Make &#038; Take Event on November 8, 2026: Magenta Flower Candle (Canada &#038; United Kingdom UK Only)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
