		<item>
		<title>LEGOLAND California &#038; Florida Hotels &#038; Ticket Packages Promo: Save an Extra $150 USD with Toys N Bricks Exclusive Coupon Code</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-california-florida-hotels-ticket-packages-promo-save-an-extra-150-usd-with-toys-n-bricks-exclusive-coupon-code/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-california-florida-hotels-ticket-packages-promo-save-an-extra-150-usd-with-toys-n-bricks-exclusive-coupon-code/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:11:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
