		<title>[US] Target Early Black Friday 2026 Deals: November 5-7, 2026 (LEGO Not Confirmed Yet)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-5-7-2026-lego-not-confirmed-yet/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-5-7-2026-lego-not-confirmed-yet/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:09:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114068</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="530" height="659" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Target US Early Black Friday Deals November 5-7, 2026 Banner Ad Logo LEGO" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO.jpg 530w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO-241x300.jpg 241w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 530px) 100vw, 530px" /></p>
<p>At Target.com US, you can always expect more and pay less. Early Black Friday 2026 November Deals are coming</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-5-7-2026-lego-not-confirmed-yet/">[US] Target Early Black Friday 2026 Deals: November 5-7, 2026 (LEGO Not Confirmed Yet)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114070 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO.jpg" alt="" width="530" height="659" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO.jpg 530w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO-241x300.jpg 241w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 530px) 100vw, 530px" /></p>
<p>At <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>, you can always expect more and pay less. Early Black Friday 2026 November Deals are coming to <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>. They will be only for 3 days from November 5-7, 2026 as advertised on their weekly flyer. We don&#8217;t know what the deals will be yet, but they did advertised that there will be 40% off select toys. LEGO deals have not been confirmed yet but they may be on the list as well!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114069 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO-Toys.jpg" alt="" width="562" height="664" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO-Toys.jpg 562w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-November-5-7-2026-Banner-Ad-Logo-LEGO-Toys-254x300.jpg 254w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 562px) 100vw, 562px" /></p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well.</strong></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you when we have more info on the Early Black Friday 2026 offers.</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. </span></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-40079 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="823" height="233" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg 1148w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-300x84.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-1024x289.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px" /></a></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/cropped-cropped-Description-Toysnbricksforum.com-LEGO-Forum-Discussion-with-Minifigures-and-Green-Border-Free-Membership-Reduced-Ads-650-x-108.jpg" alt="cropped-cropped-Description-Toysnbricksforum.com-LEGO-Forum-Discussion-with-Minifigures-and-Green-Border-Free-Membership-Reduced-Ads-650-x-108.jpg" /></a></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. Toys N Bricks is a participant of the <a href="https://amzn.to/2MZgozv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon.com</a>, <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?bbn=6303772011&amp;amp;rh=n%3A6205517011%2Cn%3A%216205518011%2Cn%3A6303772011%2Cp_89%3ALEGO&amp;amp;dc&amp;amp;fst=as%3Aoff&amp;amp;qid=1584647603&amp;amp;rnid=7590290011&amp;amp;ref=lp_6303772011_nr_p_89_1&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=5d48afd4da2b974b81ef49387a5138e8&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon.ca</a> and <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon.co.uk</a> Associates program which provides advertising fees for sites. As an Amazon Associate, Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. <em>Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. </em>Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
