					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="903" height="1038" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Upcoming LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighborhood November 2026 &amp; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Sets Revealed Front &amp; Back Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box.jpg 903w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-261x300.jpg 261w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-891x1024.jpg 891w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-768x883.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 903px) 100vw, 903px" /></p>
