										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113621 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="905" height="760" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-1024x860.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-768x645.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 905px) 100vw, 905px" /></p>
<p>The all-new LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set promotion is now live at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This Water Taxi gift set is free when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set. Promotion runs from November 1-8, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113625 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="944" height="791" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-1024x858.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-768x644.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 944px) 100vw, 944px" /></p>
