<p>As a friendly reminder, there are are still a large selection of LEGO sets retiring soon at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). <strong>See What&#8217;s Retiring Soon at the Official LEGO Site over here:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that there&#8217;s still a good selection of LEGO sets discounted as well. <strong>See LEGO Sales &amp; Deals List:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks as we regularly update and inform all of our readers of the latest LEGO Promotions, GWP and Sales &amp; Deals.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO November 2026 Promotions &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>November 1-8, 2026 (Worldwide):</strong> Free LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (Worldwide): </strong>Free LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD LEGO purchase</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30685 TIE Interceptor Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Harry Potter 30724 Dumbledore&#8217;s Office with <span style="text-decoration: underline;">SELECTED</span> LEGO Harry Potter purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (UK only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30727 TIE Advanced Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than £35 GBP</li>
<li><strong>Until November 20, 2026 (Australia only):</strong> Free 18+ LEGO 40768 Star Trek Type-15 Shuttlepod GWP with purchase of the 18+ LEGO Icons Star Trek U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D 10356 set</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
