					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="972" height="832" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO 40521 Mini Disney The Haunted Mansion August 2022 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 972w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x257.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x657.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 972px) 100vw, 972px" /></p>
<p>Happy Halloween Toys N Bricks LEGO Readers, Fans and Forum Members! Thank you all for being part of</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/happy-halloween-2026-toys-n-bricks-lego-readers-forum-members/">Happy Halloween 2026 Toys N Bricks LEGO Readers &#038; Forum Members</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Halloween Toys N Bricks LEGO Readers, Fans and Forum Members! Thank you all for being part of Toys N Bricks and for continuing to support the work that we do here. Hope you all stay safe and have a great time tonight.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-74727 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="972" height="832" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 972w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x257.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x657.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 972px) 100vw, 972px" /></p>
<p>There are always <strong>exciting free LEGO activities</strong> and discussions happening at the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is free and fast. Don&#8217;t forget to check your junk &amp; spam email/folder if you don&#8217;t see the registration activation email.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112959 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="679" height="542" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 679px) 100vw, 679px" /></p>
<p>We have on hand a brand-new copy of the LEGO 40521 Mini Disney The Haunted Mansion set. This set was released back in 2022 and contains 680 pieces and 1 minifigure. It has been discontinued and retired at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). You can still purchase this set at secondary marketplaces like at (<a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.com USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.ca Canada</a>) or (<a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a>). The set is based on the Disneyland Theme Park Haunted Mansion Ride.</p>
<p>Our <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3173-forum-members-of-the-month-october-2026-win-awesome-lego-prizes-2-winners-until-october-28-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">October 2026 LEGO Forum Member of the Month</a> recently concluded. Although we only had two prizes to award, <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/profile/727-arznix/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">forum member <em>Arznix</em></a> participated quite a bit as well. As such, we will be awarding him this unannounced Halloween LEGO set prize copy. Congrats for winning a FREE brand-new copy of the LEGO 40521 Mini Disney The Haunted Mansion set. <strong>Prize, shipping and all related taxes are paid for and sponsored by Toys N Bricks.</strong></p>
<p><em>*Disclaimer: We do not regularly award extra LEGO prizes for contests/giveaways. The only prizes awarded are typically only based on what the contest states. </em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-74728 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date.jpg" alt="" width="1044" height="763" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date.jpg 1308w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-300x219.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-1024x748.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-768x561.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1044px) 100vw, 1044px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-74726 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="972" height="832" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 972w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x257.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LEGO-40521-Mini-Disney-The-Haunted-Mansion-August-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x657.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 972px) 100vw, 972px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>Note that all new forum member posts are subject to moderation prior to them appearing. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">We regret that posts that are advertisements/self-promotion in nature will not be published or approved.</span> This is in the interest of safety measures as well as protecting the forum community from spam/ads/malicious links. After a certain amount of forum activity/history, new members that are not just here to advertise/self-promote would be released from post moderation. Thank you for your understanding.</p>
<p>With that said, we <span style="text-decoration: underline;">do allow self-promotion/advertisements to be posted</span> if you have <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribed to our Patreon Platinum Elite Tier or VIP Signature Tier</a>. Funds received will be used to support Toys N Bricks Forum Community Activities (i.e Building Contests &amp; Giveaways) as well as operational expenses. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>Toys N Bricks is free of charge to everyone. If you appreciate and like the work that we do at Toys N Bricks, you can <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe to our Patreon monthly financial support</a> starting as low as $3 USD/month. Thank you for your support.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg" alt="" width="697" height="253" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg 697w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks-300x109.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 697px) 100vw, 697px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="628" height="502" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases made. Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/happy-halloween-2026-toys-n-bricks-lego-readers-forum-members/">Happy Halloween 2026 Toys N Bricks LEGO Readers &#038; Forum Members</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
