					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/every-lego-november-2026-new-set-releases-list-sagrada-familia-cozy-plants-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:56:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[18+/Hard to Find Theme]]></category>
