		<category><![CDATA[Social]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114040</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="933" height="1167" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Every-LEGO-November-2026-New-Sets-Releases-List-Banner-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Every LEGO November 2026 New Sets Releases List Banner Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Every-LEGO-November-2026-New-Sets-Releases-List-Banner-Logo.jpg 933w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Every-LEGO-November-2026-New-Sets-Releases-List-Banner-Logo-240x300.jpg 240w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Every-LEGO-November-2026-New-Sets-Releases-List-Banner-Logo-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Every-LEGO-November-2026-New-Sets-Releases-List-Banner-Logo-768x961.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 933px) 100vw, 933px" /></p>
<p>Welcome to a brand-new month. We&#8217;re now into November 2026 and all new LEGO set releases will be</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/every-lego-november-2026-new-set-releases-list-sagrada-familia-cozy-plants-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku/">Every LEGO November 2026 New Set Releases List (Sagrada Família, Cozy Plants, Venetian Neighborhood and Dragon Ball: Shenron &#038; Goku)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113033 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Welcome to a brand-new month. We&#8217;re now into November 2026 and all new LEGO set releases will be launching at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). For those in Australia and United Kingdom, new November 2026 set releases are already live and available for purchase as its already November 1, 2026. Those in US &amp; Canada will have to wait a few more hours as these new releases are expected to go live at 21:00 PST (British Columbia/California Time) on October 31, 2026 or 0:00 EST (Toronto/New York Time) on November 1, 2026.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113614 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that from <strong>October 28 to November 8, 2026</strong>, you can also get a FREE LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD LEGO purchase too! However, we don&#8217;t expect this to last too long as the promo already did start a few days ago. Offer is only while gift set supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113737 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="780" height="908" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px" /></p>
<p>In addition, when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set, you can also get a FREE Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set as well. Offer runs from<strong> November 1-8, 2026</strong> or while supplies last. This means when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set, you&#8217;ll get <strong>two free LEGO gift sets</strong>. They include LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP and LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP. Not too bad for a new release!</p>
<ul>
